Subject: Format unknown Influx CLI encodings as integers

Origin: DHI-internal (Go 1.26 compatibility)
Description: Use an integer format directive for the OutEncoding integer type so the upstream test suite passes go vet.
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/influxdata/influx-cli.git 8cdf40161d7662e942582086853fca948fc1a842
Forwarded: no
Verify: cmd `go test ./...` expect "ok"
Drop-When: never: no upstream release currently corrects the OutEncoding format directive

diff --git a/pkg/template/out.go b/pkg/template/out.go
--- a/pkg/template/out.go
+++ b/pkg/template/out.go
@@ -60 +60 @@ func (o OutParams) WriteTemplate(template []api.TemplateEntry) error {
-		return fmt.Errorf("encoding %q is not recognized", o.Encoding)
+		return fmt.Errorf("encoding %d is not recognized", o.Encoding)
